This Python helper is used by two different metric streams, and the averages returned for one stream are contaminated by values from the other. Diagnose the bug and give the fix.

```python
def moving_avg(x, window=[]):
    window.append(x)
    if len(window) > 3:
        window.pop(0)
    return sum(window) / len(window)
```
